From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hár|lang=non}}, {{term|hór|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*hauhaz}}.

====Adjective====
{{is-adj-01|há|hátt|hærri|hæstur}}

# [[high]]
